# Optional systemd environment for this instance. Copy this file to zhiwei.env
# beside it, then replace and uncomment only the settings you need.
# The renderer references deploy/zhiwei.env by default; --service-env-file selects another file.
# This example contains no active values and never copies your current environment.
#
# Use the same service user and CODEX_HOME for login and service execution.
# CODEX_CLI_PATH points to the installed CLI executable or its codex.js entry.
# CODEX_HOME points to that service user's Codex directory; do not paste login tokens.
# PATH is a complete list, not an addition to the interactive shell's PATH.
#
# CODEX_CLI_PATH=/absolute/path/to/codex
# CODEX_HOME=/absolute/path/to/service-user-codex-home
# PATH=/absolute/path/to/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin
#
# EnvironmentFile is not a shell script: do not use export, $HOME, $PATH, ~ or
# command substitution. Put literal absolute paths in the assignments.
# Values with spaces may use single quotes, e.g. CODEX_HOME='/absolute/path with spaces'.
# Do not double percent signs here; the file's values are literal.
# After changing the file, restart the service for changes to take effect.
# Keep the local zhiwei.env private and outside Git; permissions 600 are recommended.
